Mantharā discards ornament in wrath and grief --- Mantharā mocks joy and foretells servitude to Kausalyā --- Kaikēyī praises righteous Rāma and trusts Bharata future --- Mantharā warns Bharata exclusion from royal line --- Mantharā warns Rāma will send Bharata to other world --- Mantharā cites Lakṣmaṇa pact and certain harm to Bharata --- Mantharā urges Bharata flight from Rājagr̥ha to forest --- Mantharā warns lion peril and Kausalyā revenge --- Mantharā urges kingdom for son and exile for rival
